# Crowdsource Choir coherence

Read `docs/octo-coherence.md` before planning product, sales, gardens, shows, or pitches. It governs naming. The 2027–2028 operating plan is `docs/octo-business-strategy-2027.md`.

## Company

Crowdsource Choir is the parent company, creative intelligence, and brand. A participatory entertainment company. We turn audiences into choirs and crowds into the show.

- Mission: Cultivate collective effervescence.
- Operating principle: Crowd Sourced.
- Creative philosophy: We Are the Show.
- Brand promise: Make the Moment Undeniable.

OCTO is the sales, marketing, and operational system. It is not the company name.

## Two business categories

Commissioned Experiences are client-funded and custom.

- Anthem: signature premium offering.
- Fan Chant: sports-specific offering in development.
- Custom Activations: branded Song Gardens, district activations, creative journeys.

Owned Entertainment is created by Crowdsource Choir.

- Rave Choir: flagship entertainment property.
- Themed Editions: A Thriller Night, Holiday Party, Fourth of July.
- Other Blooms: selective Song Gardens, solstice celebrations.

## The Roots

Shared creative capabilities: Song Garden (branded crowdsourcing and engagement), Composition, Musical Facilitation, Live Production, OCTO, and Creative Development. `/admin/roots` is the participation methodology inside those capabilities.

## Three conditions

Creative potential, financial viability, and quality of partnership. Prefer all three. Coherence is the core. Flow is the movement. Flourishing is the outcome.

The operating plan still applies under this frame: scale through partners and repeatable formats, develop Fan Chant from funded opportunities, and do not take on a speculative ticketed production without funding, promotion, and a break-even plan. The October 2026 queue mix in `lib/sales/strategy/playbook.ts` still directs daily sales workload.
